menu "WireGuard (esp_wireguard component)"

    config WIREGUARD_MAX_PEERS
        int "Maximum number of peers"
        default 1
        range 1 8
        help
            Peers are allocated statically inside the device structure to
            avoid malloc. This firmware only ever configures one peer.

    config WIREGUARD_MAX_SRC_IPS
        int "Maximum source IPs per peer"
        default 1
        range 1 8
        help
            Static allowed-ip slots per peer, in addition to the ones added
            at runtime via esp_wireguard_add_allowed_ip().

    config WIREGUARD_MAX_INIT_PER_SECOND
        int "Maximum handshake initiations per second"
        default 2
        range 1 10
        help
            Per-device rate limit on accepting valid initiation requests.

endmenu
